ngine/godot/pull/99564.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-03T20:47:26Z"},"body":"_This is my second attempt at this PR, the first one had problems with Git._\r\n\r\nCloses: [https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10942](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10942)\r\n\r\nAdds a method to GraphEdit to get the number of connections to a given node and port `get_connection_count(to_node,to_port)`.\r\nWith this we can easily limit the number of connections using the condition:\r\n```\r\nif get_connection_count(to_node,to_port)<1:\r\n\tconnect_node(from_node,from_port,to_node,to_port)\r\n```\r\n\r\nTest project:\r\n[graphedit_test_func.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17877358/graphedit_test_func.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99564/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99564/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason